</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Running to and fro to strengthen them,</l><l>Strengthen them, strengthen them;</l><l>Running to and fro to strengthen them</l><l>Whose heart is perfect toward Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He’s watching over those who fear Him and hope,</l><l>fear Him and hope, fear Him and hope;</l><l>He’s watching over those who fear Him and hope</l><l>In His lovingkindness.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>He’s looking on the righteous—hearing their prayer,</l><l>Hearing their prayer, hearing their prayer;</l><l>He’s looking on the righteous—hearing their prayer</l><l>He’s looking and He hearing.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>His eyes and His heart are always there,</l><l>Always there, always there;</l><l>His eyes and His heart are always there,</l><l>In the place that He has chosen.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The eyes of the Lord run to and fro,</l><l>To-to-to, fro-fro-fro;</l><l>The eyes of the Lord run to and fro</l><l>Over all the earth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
